        "solution_text": "$Q(x)-P(x)$\n$=(x^{3}-3x^{2})-(5x^{2}+2x)$\n$=x^{3}-3x^{2}-5x^{2}-2x$\n$=x^{3}-8x^{2}-2x$"
      },
      {
